<title>FINLAND: BOREALIS DIVESTS UNIT TO U.S. LEAR .</title>
<headline>BOREALIS DIVESTS UNIT TO U.S. LEAR .</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polyolefins group Borealis Holding AB said in a statement on Friday it had signed a letter of intent to sell its car interior parts maker Borealis Industrier AB to Lear Corporation of the United States.</p>
<p>&quot;The details of the deal were not made public,&quot; Borealis said.</p>
<p>Borealis is 50/50-owned by Finnish state-controlled oil and energy group Neste Oy and Norwegian state-owned oil group Statoil AS .</p>
